{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/529cf72c698f9a3ab86f7be8a495269e.poster.avif?t=1756879751\" width=612 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/529cf72c698f9a3ab86f7be8a495269e.webm?t=1756879751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/529cf72c698f9a3ab86f7be8a495269e.mp4?t=1756879751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Scavenge, Fight, Escape&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/e2e16fb8067de85b9471d2fb62dffc09.poster.avif?t=1756879751\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/e2e16fb8067de85b9471d2fb62dffc09.webm?t=1756879751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Midnight Walkers is a hardcore <strong>PvPvE FPS zombie extraction game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play in <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>trios mode</strong>. You must scavenge for loot to get gear, kill zombies and other survivors, and escape. <strong>If you successfully escape</strong>, you can craft with materials and buy/sell more powerful equipment, but if you die, you will lose everything you had.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Liberty Grand Center mega-complex&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/5761c21487c37dd440022ad3ea70acbd.poster.avif?t=1756879751\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/5761c21487c37dd440022ad3ea70acbd.webm?t=1756879751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberty Grand Center, a giant mega-complex in Golden County, has floors with different themes and unique loot, including a hospital, a shopping mall, and a casino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The threats here are not just zombies or other survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, the <strong>poison gas system</strong> spreads to random floors, and you must use elevators or stairs to avoid it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: every time you move to another floor, your chances of encountering other survivors will increase.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Choose Your Class&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/02f96739fbd1ef9246605f2fb0537ca3.poster.avif?t=1756879751\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/02f96739fbd1ef9246605f2fb0537ca3.webm?t=1756879751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRICK</strong>, a steadfast warrior armed with a large hammer and heavy armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROW</strong>, an assassin with nimble movements who uses daggers to strike opponents off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCKDOWN</strong>, a sniper who can attack from a distance using a bow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARGARITA</strong>, a supporter who can mix cocktails to heal and buff allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the one that fits your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Face Your Enemies&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/3c653d2508ae31603e5a540b043d4016.poster.avif?t=1756879751\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/3c653d2508ae31603e5a540b043d4016.webm?t=1756879751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombies here are all deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the weakest zombie, the <strong>Walker</strong>, can be a great threat if you are surrounded, and there are also zombies more lethally mutated than the <strong>Runner</strong>, which fiercely pursues survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In any case, the biggest threat is other survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triumph over other survivors, alone or with your teammates, and seize more loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best show in Golden County, and the only show!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We look forward to your performance in The Midnight Walkers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2795540?t=1756879751","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/2ba19d0b2269f34994d4028df1389a041ee240c6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756879751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/851c09ab32b89d9b7a5f5cd97e097e29a23e47b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756879751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/851c09ab32b89d9b7a5f5cd97e097e29a23e47b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756879751","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/529cf72c698f9a3ab86f7be8a495269e.poster.avif?t=1756879751\" width=612 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/529cf72c698f9a3ab86f7be8a495269e.webm?t=1756879751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/529cf72c698f9a3ab86f7be8a495269e.mp4?t=1756879751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Scavenge, Fight, Escape&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/e2e16fb8067de85b9471d2fb62dffc09.poster.avif?t=1756879751\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/e2e16fb8067de85b9471d2fb62dffc09.webm?t=1756879751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Midnight Walkers is a hardcore <strong>PvPvE FPS zombie extraction game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play in <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>trios mode</strong>. You must scavenge for loot to get gear, kill zombies and other survivors, and escape. <strong>If you successfully escape</strong>, you can craft with materials and buy/sell more powerful equipment, but if you die, you will lose everything you had.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Liberty Grand Center mega-complex&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/5761c21487c37dd440022ad3ea70acbd.poster.avif?t=1756879751\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/5761c21487c37dd440022ad3ea70acbd.webm?t=1756879751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liberty Grand Center, a giant mega-complex in Golden County, has floors with different themes and unique loot, including a hospital, a shopping mall, and a casino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The threats here are not just zombies or other survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, the <strong>poison gas system</strong> spreads to random floors, and you must use elevators or stairs to avoid it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: every time you move to another floor, your chances of encountering other survivors will increase.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Choose Your Class&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/02f96739fbd1ef9246605f2fb0537ca3.poster.avif?t=1756879751\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/02f96739fbd1ef9246605f2fb0537ca3.webm?t=1756879751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRICK</strong>, a steadfast warrior armed with a large hammer and heavy armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROW</strong>, an assassin with nimble movements who uses daggers to strike opponents off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCKDOWN</strong>, a sniper who can attack from a distance using a bow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARGARITA</strong>, a supporter who can mix cocktails to heal and buff allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the one that fits your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Face Your Enemies&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/3c653d2508ae31603e5a540b043d4016.poster.avif?t=1756879751\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795540/extras/3c653d2508ae31603e5a540b043d4016.webm?t=1756879751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombies here are all deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the weakest zombie, the <strong>Walker</strong>, can be a great threat if you are surrounded, and there are also zombies more lethally mutated than the <strong>Runner</strong>, which fiercely pursues survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In any case, the biggest threat is other survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Triumph over other survivors, alone or with your teammates, and seize more loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best show in Golden County, and the only show!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We look forward to your performance in The Midnight Walkers.</p>","developers":["Oneway Ticket Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"de